---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Corporate Fitness and Wellness in Austin';
const description = 'Corporate fitness and wellness in Austin for companies seeking employee fitness, recovery, nutrition and mental performance support.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Austin Corporate Wellness</div><h1>Corporate fitness and wellness in Austin.</h1><p class="lead">Austin companies can use practical wellness programming to support healthier employees, stronger habits and better energy throughout the workweek.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="container"><article>

<h2>Why Austin companies need practical wellness support</h2><p>Fast-growing teams often need wellness options that are flexible, easy to use and not dependent on everyone being in the same office. A digital wellness app can support hybrid teams with guided workouts, recovery, mindset and nutrition education.</p><h2>Recommended program components</h2><ul><li>Beginner-friendly strength training and conditioning.</li><li>Body care routines for employees who sit for long periods.</li><li>Stress-management tools and short breathing practices.</li><li>Nutrition lessons employees can apply during busy workweeks.</li><li>Simple progress tracking to encourage consistency.</li></ul><h2>How to use this page</h2><p>This local landing page can target Austin businesses searching for employee wellness, corporate fitness, workplace fitness apps and hybrid team wellness tools.</p><div class="callout"><strong>Content angle:</strong> This page should connect the topic back to the app naturally. Mention guided training, body care, nutrition education and mental performance where relevant without forcing a sales pitch.</div>
</article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
